      "The two graph views focus the correct exact declarations. The real-L2 leaf displays the actual centered consumer; the actual branch displays macro-root/rough-gradient/Poincare/real-square-order references. Legends distinguish imports/ownership from incomplete scanned references and conceptual/source relations.",
      "The narrow B16 input consumer is explicitly distinguished from a completed public polar/onto theorem; remaining paper/dynamics/cost/composition leaves stay open."
